{"code":"YL10","wikidata":"Q119722574","wikipedia":{"en":"Si Kritha MRT station","th":"สถานีศรีกรีฑา"},"summary":{"en":"Si Kritha station is a Bangkok MRT station on the Yellow Line. The station is located on Srinagarindra Road in Bang Kapi District, Bangkok and is a portmanteau of the name of Srinagarindra and Krungthep Kritha roads, of which intersect adjacent to the station. The station has four entrances.","th":"สถานีศรีกรีฑา เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้ามหานครแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสีเหลือง โดยยกระดับเหนือถนนศรีนครินทร์ในพื้นที่เขตบางกะปิ กรุงเทพมหานคร"},"opened":"2023-06-12","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/97/Si_Kritha_Station_01.jpg/960px-Si_Kritha_Station_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Si_Kritha_Station_01.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c5/Si_Kritha_Station_02.jpg/960px-Si_Kritha_Station_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Si_Kritha_Station_02.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/56/Si_Kritha_Station_03.jpg/960px-Si_Kritha_Station_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Si_Kritha_Station_03.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bc/Si_Kritha_Station_04.jpg/960px-Si_Kritha_Station_04.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Si_Kritha_Station_04.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/Si_Kritha_Station_05.jpg/960px-Si_Kritha_Station_05.jpg?utm_s